{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":147416,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"lorishultz2016,\n\nRandL2015 has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Chair ties\".\n\nRandL2015 said:\n======================================================================\nDo you still need them? I have some green and purple. How many do you need?\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=13527#msg23487\n","Sender":{"Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1463312452,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":13527},{"Id":146663,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that acw271011 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80072-looking-for-iteams-to-buy\/?view=findpost&p=1913280\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"lorishultz2016\" There are a number of sites on the internet that sell them at a pretty reasonable price. I've seen them as low as about 40 cents each in organza. If you want satin I think they cost a little more, but not a ton. If you're only looking for about 20 of each, 60 in total, I'm sure you could get them all for about $40, especially being in the US. The brides in canada are the ones that get killed on the shipping, even more so if it's a US site and they ship internationally.\n \nhttp:\/\/www.chaircoverfactory.com\/Chair-Sashes-s\/254.htm\n \nhttp:\/\/www.weddinglinensdirect.com\/chairsashes.html\n \nhttp:\/\/www.tableclothsfactory.com\/?&gclid=Cj0KEQjwmKG5BRDv4YaE5t6oqf0BEiQAwqDNfJ3oBW6my9uI7uovkmwNEfg6nScy_mnj0Pz1a6dHMMQaAtIr8P8HAQ\n \nhttp:\/\/www.linentablecloth.com\/chair-covers-and-sashes\/chair-sashes.html\n \nhttp:\/\/www.efavormart.com\/wedding-chair-sashes.aspx\n \n \nI got mine at efavormart and they were just great so I would recommend them, but I'm sure if any of the other ladies have had an experience with any of the other suppliers they'll chime in with a review.\n \nGood luck!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1462278156,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":145072,"Title":"liked a post you made in Don't Know Where To Begin","Message":"Hello!\n\namberguesa just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI am also having mine at Dreams Punta Cana.  I can say the place looks really nice and they are very kid friendly. And your wedding is the only one,on that day and almost everyone has there wedding in Mexico.   And from what I have heard Punta Cana is a really pretty place to visit\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80031-dont-know-where-to-begin\/?view=findpost&p=1912691\n","Sender":{"Id":286470,"Name":"amberguesa","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286470.jpg?_r=1457927739","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1460200240,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":145067,"Title":"liked a post you made in Don't Know Where To Begin","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI am also having mine at Dreams Punta Cana.  I can say the place looks really nice and they are very kid friendly. And your wedding is the only one,on that day and almost everyone has there wedding in Mexico.   And from what I have heard Punta Cana is a really pretty place to visit\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80031-dont-know-where-to-begin\/?view=findpost&p=1912691\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1460197401,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":143624,"Title":"liked a post you made in Punta Cana Venue 2017","Message":"Hello!\n\namberguesa just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nCongratulations... I am getting married in Punta Cana in July 2016. The place your looking at looks really nice. We are getting married at a hotel there.. if you have any good ideas please if you can pass them on to me too... thanks and happy planning\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80013-punta-cana-venue-2017\/?view=findpost&p=1912261\n","Sender":{"Id":286470,"Name":"amberguesa","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286470.jpg?_r=1457927739","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1459373538,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":141026,"Title":"liked a post you made in Destination Wedding In 2017...","Message":"Hello!\n\nCandanceWilliams2be just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI am sure they would send you all the info you might need also check trip advisor they sometimes give info.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79547-destination-wedding-in-2017-in-dr\/?view=findpost&p=1903751\n","Sender":{"Id":284619,"Name":"CandanceWilliams2be","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284619.jpg?_r=1440956169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1456520916,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":141005,"Title":"liked a post you made in Newbie - Cofresi Palm Beach...","Message":"Hello!\n\nCandanceWilliams2be just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nCongrats it always feels great when you get a project done. If you don't mine me asking what did you put in your oot bags. Im having a,hard time deciding what to,put,in them. Thanks\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79712-newbie-cofresi-palm-beach-puerto-plata-jan-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1907258\n","Sender":{"Id":284619,"Name":"CandanceWilliams2be","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284619.jpg?_r=1440956169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1456502299,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"7","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
