> User lorishultz2016 (284536)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.69.140.152","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79922,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f265acd6c3ceca3261447a812eac193","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;What are you planning to give out as wedding favours?.&lt;span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;I know chocolates are classic wedding favors. But what\u2019s wrong in choosing something classic. I am planning to make some home made chocolates and get them &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.clearpak.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/03\/Cannon-0971.jpg&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(17,85,204);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;packed them in pvc plastic packing boxes&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;. I am also planning to add our picture and date on top .&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:14.6667px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;You don\u2019t have to spend a lot to do this. It\u2019s something special because instead of buying you are making something for your guests.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910508,"PostDate":1454545475,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What are you planning to give out as wedding favours?.<span  style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">I know chocolates are classic wedding favors. But what\u2019s wrong in choosing something classic. I am planning to make some home made chocolates and get them \u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.clearpak.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/03\/Cannon-0971.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(17,85,204);background-color:transparent\">packed them in pvc plastic packing boxes<\/span><\/a><span  style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">. I am also planning to add our picture and date on top .<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:14.6667px;background-color:transparent\">\u00a0You don\u2019t have to spend a lot to do this. It\u2019s something special because instead of buying you are making something for your guests.<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissadavis11@outlook.com","IpAddress":"158.69.140.152","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1454545205,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"melissadavis","Id":286129,"Name":"melissadavis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.41.78","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79922,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6054cad6b041f97442447c514d4b36b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Generally with a destination wedding brides will do something more local to where they&#039;re having their wedding. Many brides have done maracas with a Mexico wedding or small tequila bottles. I&#039;ve seen a couple of suggestions as well for Jamaican destination weddings. With chocolates you still need to worry about transporting them, no matter how they&#039;re packed and if you&#039;re in a tropical climate, chocolate doesn&#039;t hold up that well sitting out on tables.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910542,"PostDate":1454632752,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Generally with a destination wedding brides will do something more local to where they're having their wedding. Many brides have done maracas with a Mexico wedding or small tequila bottles. I've seen a couple of suggestions as well for Jamaican destination weddings. With chocolates you still need to worry about transporting them, no matter how they're packed and if you're in a tropical climate, chocolate doesn't hold up that well sitting out on tables.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"131.137.245.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79922,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f4c2e5f470127b021eee8002eaa00fb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;just be careful with chocolate - the heat may turn them into chocolate sauce :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913489,"PostDate":1462867393,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>just be careful with chocolate - the heat may turn them into chocolate sauce <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adamphall@ymail.com","IpAddress":"131.137.245.206","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1462864536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286918.jpg?_r=1462901352","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AdamnJenn17","Id":286918,"Name":"AdamnJenn17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.35.43.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79922,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d82c1ae4ad72e4298267e54f6367f4c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"melissadavis\"] I would also suggest making sure you can bring them into the country. Sometimes they won&#039;t allow it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913748,"PostDate":1463336887,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286129\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286129-melissadavis\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">melissadavis<\/span><\/a> I would also suggest making sure you can bring them into the country. Sometimes they won't allow it.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wonderlandgrl3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407856186,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279411.jpg?_r=1408152053","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mangosong","Id":279411,"Name":"Mangosong","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":